'''Hardcore Tombs''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete the [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid solo without dying, at level 150 or above. The Hardcore Run invocation does not need to be active in order to complete the achievement.

